          "publicSpeech": "只谈繁殖季少惊扰与少捕猎，不披露具体猎物或巢地位置。"
        },
        {
          "collection": "npcs",
          "id": "npc_hw_wushuo",
          "field": "relationships[0].note",
          "hash": "7cfedee65f8759bb5727151b6f13b5e478166a14cdeb1a8fed2a8bb569a39b30",
          "visibility": "private",
          "publicSpeech": "只说明已有林果边界往来涉及少惊扰繁殖地。"
        },
        {
          "collection": "npcs",
          "id": "npc_hw_meiling",
          "field": "goals.long[0].content",
          "hash": "9531f2b70dfc3bfbc1eb0fac4d81e1ae0bb4c8eda737f5a7edff7d4ec37f7dd8",
          "visibility": "private",
          "publicSpeech": "只说公用果园需要长期共同照护，不公开仪式、洪水损失细节或本人秘密。"
        },
        {
          "collection": "npcs",
          "id": "npc_hw_anhuai",
          "field": "goals.mid[0].content",
          "hash": "2cebc68d52faafd7571f97adabcd3d4c2c9d97214a52809728c99fece28f1e3a",
          "visibility": "private",
          "publicSpeech": "只说有意参加经同意的农业试验，不把愿望当作实际参加或已获许可。"
        },
        {
          "collection": "npcs",
          "id": "npc_hw_anhuai",
          "field": "relationships[0].note",
          "hash": "851d9b6434a818a901747f82d34a46de1a8063fea3fbc7ebc52945c8a6105628",
          "visibility": "private",
          "publicSpeech": "只解释蜂场和公用果园在授粉上的可能共同利益。"
        }
      ],
